DATA NOTICE

All data in this repository is SYNTHETIC. The customers, technicians, jobs,
invoices and leads are generated records; none of them describe a real person,
household or transaction.

Some warehouse columns are shaped like personal data -- dw.DimCustomer carries
CustomerName, Email, Phone and consent flags -- because a real jobs-and-invoices
warehouse would carry them, and modelling around that shape is part of the
exercise. The values in those columns are fabricated. They are deliberately not
surfaced in the semantic model, which exposes only CustomerKey, status, lead
source and created date.

"Justice Installations" is a fictitious company created for this portfolio
project. Any resemblance to an existing business is coincidental.
